OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FParamedics and police bring in a
OL,7,     Fman with multiple stab wounds to
OL,8,     Fhis chest but medics struggle to
OL,9,     Ftreat him when he lashes out at
OL,10,     Fthem both physically and verbally.
OL,11,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,12,     FFour top dermatologists treat
OL,13,     Fpatients for skin conditions such
OL,14,     Fas cysts, lipomas and skin tags
OL,15,     Fthat the NHS views as cosmetic,
OL,16,     Fbut that can hugely affect the
OL,17,     Fsufferers.
