OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FParamedics bring in care home
OL,7,     Fmanager Kirsty, who has fallen
OL,8,     Fbadly. And the team must stabilise
OL,9,     F67-year-old Bridget, whose
OL,10,     Fheartbeat is twice as fast as it
OL,11,     Fshould be.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     F28-year-old Kirsten wants to get
OL,14,     Frid of a cyst on her stomach that
